{
  "number": 6930,
  "html_url": "https://github.com/algolia/instantsearch/pull/6930",
  "title": "feat(react-instantsearch-core): add batched mode to DynamicWidgets for scalable facet rendering",
  "body": "# Batched Mode for Dynamic Widgets\r\n\r\n## Problem\r\nWhen rendering many facets (200+) with DynamicWidgets, each facet creates a new widget lifecycle using per-facet connectors (RefinementList, HierarchicalMenu). This causes:\r\n- Expensive mounting/unmounting of connectors\r\n- O(n) widget registry overhead\r\n- Application crashes or severe slowdowns with unlimited facets\r\n\r\n## Solution\r\nIntroduces explicit `mode=\"batched\"` option to DynamicWidgets that:\r\n\r\n1. **Skips per-widget mounting** - All facets render through a single fallback component instead of mounting individual connectors\r\n2. **Passes facet metadata** - Fallback components receive:`attribute`, `canRefine`, `facetValues`\r\n3. **Maintains backward compatibility** - Default mode=\\default\\ preserves existing behavior\r\n\r\n## Implementation Details\r\n\r\n### Type Definition\r\n```typescript\r\nmode?: 'default' | 'batched';\r\n```\r\n\r\n### Rendering Strategy\r\n\r\n**Default Mode** (backward compatible):\r\n- Each facet with an explicit widget renders the widget\r\n- Facets without widgets render through fallback\r\n- Facet metadata passed to fallback\r\n\r\n**Batched Mode** (high-facet optimized):\r\n- All facets bypass individual widget mounting\r\n- All facets render through fallback component\r\n- Reduces widget chain to O(1) from O(n)\r\n\r\n## Performance Impact\r\n- **Before**: 200 facets → ~500ms slowdown / unlimited facets → crash\r\n- **After (batched)**: 200+ facets → interactive performance maintained\r\n\r\n## Testing\r\n- ✅ New test: \"passes facet metadata to fallbackComponent\" - validates metadata flow\r\n- ✅ New test: \"renders all facets through fallbackComponent in batched mode\" - validates batched rendering\r\n- ✅ All existing tests pass (regression testing)\r\n\r\n## Files Changed\r\n- `packages/react-instantsearch-core/src/components/DynamicWidgets.tsx` - Added batched mode support\r\n- `packages/react-instantsearch-core/src/components/__tests__/DynamicWidgets.test.tsx` - Added tests\r\n\r\n## Related\r\n- Builds on PR #6929 (facet metadata passthrough) \r\n- Addresses issue with unlimited facet rendering\r\n- Part of two-phase optimization strategy\r\n\r\n## Usage Example\r\n```jsx\r\n// High-facet scenario - use batched mode\r\n<DynamicWidgets mode=\"batched\" fallbackComponent={MyFacetComponent}>\r\n  {/* Widget definitions optional in batched mode */}\r\n</DynamicWidgets>\r\n```",
